{
    "background_story": "Kali was a brilliant and fearless astronaut who had spent years training for the ultimate test: a solo mission to Mars. As she soared through the cosmos, she faced numerous challenges that pushed her skills and endurance to the limit. From navigating treacherous asteroid fields to troubleshooting malfunctioning equipment, Kali proved herself to be a true pioneer. But the greatest test of all came when her ship experienced a catastrophic failure, leaving her stranded on the Martian surface with limited supplies. Kali drew upon every ounce of knowledge and experience to improvise repairs and survive the harsh environment. Her ingenuity and determination ultimately led to a successful rescue, earning her the respect and admiration of her peers and cementing her place in the annals of space exploration history.",
